{"id":"bolsillo","lemma":"bolsillo","pos":"noun","rank":1485,"glosses":["pocket","pocketbook (personal resources)"],"ipa":"/bolˈsiʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bolsillos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-bolsillo.wav","examples":[{"text":"No tengo dinero en el bolsillo.","en":"I have no money in my pocket.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594355","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"¿Qué más tienes en el bolsillo?","en":"What else do you have in your pocket?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609613","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Está en mi bolsillo.","en":"It's in my pocket.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/269381","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Mantén tus manos lejos de tus bolsillos.","en":"Keep your hands out of your pockets.","words":[{"g":"to keep","l":"mantener"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"hand","l":"mano"},null,null,{"g":"your"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"far from"]]},{"text":"Él se sacó algo del bolsillo.","en":"He took something out of his pocket.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687745","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to put out, to get out","l":"sacar"},{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"of the"},null]}]}